{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994187020416001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"rife-serif-fist","assignee":null,"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":1},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783060805822400001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# gitleaks false-positive on a docs example secret blocks docs changes (+ 189 unblock)\n\n## What\ngitleaks' generic-api-key rule flags a DOCUMENTED throwaway placeholder in docs\n(docs/llm-framework.md:311 `export LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-lf-1234567890`), and because the\nsecret detector scans the whole CHANGED FILE, any edit to that file (e.g. change 189) is\nforce-BLOCKed. Fix the false-positive class without weakening detection of genuine secrets.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Add a `.gitleaks.toml` allowlist scoped to documented placeholder patterns (sk-lf-/pk-lf- throwaways; docs example keys) — NOT a blanket **/*.md exclusion (a real doc secret must still block).\n- [ ] Fix the misleading docs/llm-framework.md:311 placeholder to an obviously-non-secret form.\n- [ ] The secret detector still fail-closes on a genuine secret (a test/fixture proves a real pattern still matches).\n- [ ] This sits at/before change 189 in the Gerrit stack so 189's re-review passes gitleaks; make lint green; commit carries a rebar-ticket trailer.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","9322-f84a-e047-4471"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9322-f84a-e047-4471","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a6a5-f4a0-c5e6-40a8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"gitleaks false-positive on docs example secret blocks docs changes","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8e19648b-7207-4508-82f3-24287b47f68f"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994187020416001,"uuid":"8d68b17f-ddb7-44ca-82b0-e97c8eec40e8"}